<title>USA: Cardima Inc IPO range reduced - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Cardima Inc IPO range reduced - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price range for Cardima Inc's initial public offering was reduced to 8 to 9 per share from 10 to 12 a share, said underwriter Bear, Stearns &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to price 2.3 million shares June 6.</p>
<p>Cardima makes microcatherters that treat abnormal heart rhythms.</p>
</text>
